            <li>Hirshkowitz, M., Whiton, K., Albert, S. M., et al. (2015). National Sleep Foundation&#8217;s sleep time duration recommendations: Methodology and results summary. <em>Sleep Health</em>, 1(1):40&#8211;43. <a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/26350345/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PubMed</a></li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <!-- DISCLAIMER -->
        <div class="disclaimer">
