            <strong>Medical disclaimer:</strong> This article is for informational and educational purposes only. It is not a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always seek the advice of a qualified healthcare provider with any questions you may have regarding a medical condition or sleep disorder. Never disregard professional medical advice or delay seeking it because of something you have read on this website.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </article>
